    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/bg1v1z-zg/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=612312029432120283&sectionId=612312029566338011)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2Kio-QIC6_text","label":"gg2Kio-QIC6_text","default":"<p>Tatiana Reynolds</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggx6fkxnbCt_text","label":"ggx6fkxnbCt_text","default":"<p>Ok real question… can anyone vouch for Peak Form? I’m 52, HRT helped hot flashes but I’m still gaining and exhausted. My doctor says it’s “just menopause.” 😭</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXndN1mtOK_text","label":"ggXndN1mtOK_text","default":"<p>Like</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZkoXT6nmB_text","label":"ggZkoXT6nmB_text","default":"<p>Reply</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUpSog57fI_text","label":"ggUpSog57fI_text","default":"<p>15</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwLRx5U2yi_text","label":"ggwLRx5U2yi_text","default":"<p>39 min</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1ZKDS3M8V_text","label":"gg1ZKDS3M8V_text","default":"<p>Mary Vernon</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKyMYz5ZaP_text","label":"ggKyMYz5ZaP_text","default":"<p>Yes!! I’m on HRT and my gynecologist kept saying the weight was just menopause. 🙃<br>Peak Form was the first thing that made my body feel like it’s responding again. I can eat a normal dinner without waking up 3 lbs heavier. The scale finally started moving too. Turns out it wasn’t just menopause — my thyroid conversion needed help. these liquid drops anytime soon...</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggT8O1VT88Q_text","label":"ggT8O1VT88Q_text","default":"<p>Like</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMsRI1r_QT_text","label":"ggMsRI1r_QT_text","default":"<p>Reply</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYfsARZSYl_text","label":"ggYfsARZSYl_text","default":"<p>5</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2CTp-mTPW_text","label":"gg2CTp-mTPW_text","default":"<p>15 min</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXAS4GXDeS_text","label":"ggXAS4GXDeS_text","default":"<p>Doris Skylar</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJboRhie93_text","label":"ggJboRhie93_text","default":"<p>I’m 3 weeks into Peak Form. I’m 54 and tried every menopause supplement. I didn’t expect weight loss honestly, I just wanted the “stuck” feeling to stop. But then I started dropping weight without starving myself. That has not happened since perimenopause started!!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLErtJ0zV__text","label":"ggLErtJ0zV__text","default":"<p>Like</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGNAnoyIBS_text","label":"ggGNAnoyIBS_text","default":"<p>Reply</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggu7yvE8CpE_text","label":"ggu7yvE8CpE_text","default":"<p>5</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gggIg7Nwoyf_text","label":"gggIg7Nwoyf_text","default":"<p>39 min</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUm4UM8GE6_text","label":"ggUm4UM8GE6_text","default":"<p>Jess Smith</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmLxbD_zSO_text","label":"ggmLxbD_zSO_text","default":"<p>Same. Since menopause every calorie hit me different. With Peak Form I can eat a normal dinner and not wake up puffy and 5 lbs heavier. That’s the biggest change. My body is actually processing food again 😩</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEMjRZudEu_text","label":"ggEMjRZudEu_text","default":"<p>Like</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqrKOJUlId_text","label":"ggqrKOJUlId_text","default":"<p>Reply</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcXOUaweAh_text","label":"ggcXOUaweAh_text","default":"<p>43</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBJZwZbQXa_text","label":"ggBJZwZbQXa_text","default":"<p>1hr</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4g1WeatPf_text","label":"gg4g1WeatPf_text","default":"<p>Krissie Ells</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gguFbGXrqcj_text","label":"gguFbGXrqcj_text","default":"<p>I’m 51 and Peak Form is the first thing since menopause that let me eat like a normal person without paying for it on the scale. Not stopping these drops anytime soon...</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvUEBof0F7_text","label":"ggvUEBof0F7_text","default":"<p>Like</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGdnD-UZSY_text","label":"ggGdnD-UZSY_text","default":"<p>Reply</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggeA9TTmSYp_text","label":"ggeA9TTmSYp_text","default":"<p>5</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQ7kx6ljjO_text","label":"ggQ7kx6ljjO_text","default":"<p>12 min</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gghQKlf4A66_text","label":"gghQKlf4A66_text","default":"<p>Jess Smith</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjYC6-Gqwm_text","label":"ggjYC6-Gqwm_text","default":"<p>Exactly. So many of us were told it was just menopause. Glad we found what was actually going on! These drops work!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggN_OyFoht2_text","label":"ggN_OyFoht2_text","default":"<p>Like</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg403A_rEqi_text","label":"gg403A_rEqi_text","default":"<p>Reply</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHTm1KmoQ4_text","label":"ggHTm1KmoQ4_text","default":"<p>6</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-bkyCLhNw_text","label":"gg-bkyCLhNw_text","default":"<p>5 min</p>"}],
